index.opensource.title=Free as in freedom
index.opensource.text=While some companies focus on maximising profitability, we have chosen to have a social impact. We are concerned about education and scientific research. Algorab is licensed under a free software licence, allowing anyone to use, study, modify and redistribute the project, promoting knowledge sharing and collaboration a sustainable future.
index.indev.title=Project in development
index.indev.text=Algorab is still in development. The website will be edited as the project progresses and news will be sent to newsletter subscribers.
